{"bookId": "694734", "title": "QED：光和物质的奇妙理论", "bookmarks": {"synckey": 1665411627, "updated": [{"bookId": "694734", "bookmarkId": "694734_9_6126-6267", "createTime": 1665411627, "range": "6126-6267", "markText": "发现电子后不久，原子被想象为一个小小的太阳系，它由重的部分（称为核）和这些沿“轨道”运转的电子组成，这些电子很像绕太阳旋转的行星。如果你认为原子就是这样，那你就返回到了1910年。（应该说是1913年，这一年N·波尔（Niels Bohr）提出了原子中电子绕核旋转的模型——译注。）", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9}, {"bookId": "694734", "bookmarkId": "694734_8_10860-11003", "createTime": 1665321757, "range": "10860-11003", "markText": "这个图的曲线将同我们原来绘制的光从镜面反射的那个图的曲线很相似：它始于最高点，然后向下，再返回向上；最重要的贡献来自箭头指向几乎同一方向的那些地方（在那里，一个路径与相邻路径所需时间相同），这就是曲线底部所对应的地方。这里也是所需时间最短的地方，所以我们要做的就是找出哪里是需时最短之处", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8}, {"bookId": "694734", "bookmarkId": "694734_8_10499-10614", "createTime": 1665321284, "range": "10499-10614", "markText": "更重要的是，演示镜子所有部分都进行反射这个事实真相说明了，事件发生的每种可能的方式都有一个振幅。而且为了正确计算在不同情况下一个事件发生的概率，我们必须把代表事件发生的所有可能方式的箭头都加起来，而不是只加我们认为重要的那些箭头。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8}], "removed": [], "chapters": [{"title": "3.电子和它们的相互作用", "chapterUid": 9, "chapterIdx": 9}, {"title": "2.光子：光的粒子", "chapterUid": 8, "chapterIdx": 8}], "book": {"bookId": "694734", "version": 325453624, "format": "epub", "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/734/694734/s_694734.jpg", "title": "QED：光和物质的奇妙理论", "author": "R·P·费曼著 徐一鸿序", "coverBoxInfo": {"blurhash": "KELq%}17xB1TA1xV9#I[oI", "colors": [{"key": "1/4", "hex": "#001e35"}, {"key": "1/6", "hex": "#001f40"}, {"key": "1/8", "hex": "#00204c"}, {"key": "2/4", "hex": "#14334a"}, {"key": "2/6", "hex": "#003557"}, {"key": "2/8", "hex": "#003664"}, {"key": "3/4", "hex": "#2a4b63"}, {"key": "3/6", "hex": "#074c70"}, {"key": "3/8", "hex": "#004d7d"}, {"key": "3/12", "hex": "#005097"}, {"key": "4/6", "hex": "#316587"}, {"key": "4/10", "hex": "#0068a1"}, {"key": "4/4", "hex": "#45637a"}, {"key": "5/10", "hex": "#0082bc"}, {"key": "5/4", "hex": "#607d93"}, {"key": "5/8", "hex": "#3280ae"}, {"key": "6/4", "hex": "#7a97ac"}, {"key": "6/6", "hex": "#6899ba"}, {"key": "6/8", "hex": "#519bc8"}, {"key": "6/12", "hex": "#009ee6"}, {"key": "7/8", "hex": "#6cb5e3"}, {"key": "7/10", "hex": "#49b7f3"}, {"key": "7/12", "hex": "#00b9ff"}, {"key": "8/4", "hex": "#adcce2"}, {"key": "8/6", "hex": "#99cff1"}, {"key": "8/12", "hex": "#00d5ff"}, {"key": "9/2", "hex": "#d8e5ed"}, {"key": "9/12", "hex": "#32f2ff"}, {"key": "1/100", "hex": "#519bc8"}, {"key": "2/100", "hex": "#6cb5e3"}, {"key": "3/100", "hex": "#ffffff"}, {"key": "4/100", "hex": "#E5ECF3"}, {"key": "5/100", "hex": "#E5ECF3"}, {"key": "6/100", "hex": "#001927"}], "dominate_color": {"hex": "#31b7f9", "hsv": [199.83382355077103, 80.13706149073263, 97.65909633282952]}, "custom_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookalphacover/734/694734/s_694734.jpg", "custom_rec_cover": "https://weread-1258476243.file.myqcloud.com/bookreccover/734/694734/s_694734.jpg", "colorsPure": ["#009ee6", "#00b9ff"]}}}, "reviews": {"reviews": [{"reviewId": "17408780_7CUvQBcNN", "review": {"bookId": "694734", "content": "宇宙的四种力", "bookVersion": 1115734296, "range": "7313-7409", "abstract": "这些作用中每一个都有个振幅——即一个箭头，根据一定的规则，可以把它计算出来。等一下我将告诉你们这些规则（或定律）是什么。有了这些规则，我们可以把整个世界给造出来。（原子核和万有引力永远除外！）", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "reviewId": "17408780_7CUvQBcNN", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1665412084, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "694734", "format": "epub", "version": 325453624, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/734/694734/s_694734.jpg", "title": "QED：光和物质的奇妙理论", "author": "R·P·费曼著 徐一鸿序", "translator": "张钟静", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "3.电子和它们的相互作用", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7CUvBj3Gm", "review": {"bookId": "694734", "content": "宏观层面失去了微观的大量信息，而宏观与微观的界限取决于人类的神经感知系统，所以即使有外星人于我们生存在同样的宇宙定律下，其对宇宙的认知也很难与人类一致。", "bookVersion": 1115734296, "range": "6481-6587", "abstract": "当我们从大尺度上——和记秒表转一周相应的距离比起来要大得多——看光子时，我们看到的现象与诸如“光走直线”这类规则很接近，这是因为在最短时间路径的周围有相当大量的路径在相互加强，而相当大量的其他路径则相互抵销掉了。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 9, "reviewId": "17408780_7CUvBj3Gm", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1665411858, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "694734", "format": "epub", "version": 325453624, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/734/694734/s_694734.jpg", "title": "QED：光和物质的奇妙理论", "author": "R·P·费曼著 徐一鸿序", "translator": "张钟静", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 9, "chapterTitle": "3.电子和它们的相互作用", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7CSGNBFKi", "review": {"bookId": "694734", "content": "G点，费曼真幽默", "bookVersion": 1115734296, "range": "4721-4725", "abstract": "中央G点", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 8, "reviewId": "17408780_7CSGNBFKi", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1665308517, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "694734", "format": "epub", "version": 325453624, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/734/694734/s_694734.jpg", "title": "QED：光和物质的奇妙理论", "author": "R·P·费曼著 徐一鸿序", "translator": "张钟静", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 8, "chapterTitle": "2.光子：光的粒子", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7CSECeWno", "review": {"bookId": "694734", "content": "为什么秒针转得快？红光与蓝光的速度是一样的，区别是波长，所以秒针转速与波长有关？", "bookVersion": 1115734296, "range": "24413-24520", "abstract": "反射的这个循环之所以以不同的速率重复，是因为记秒表指针在对蓝光子计时的时候，比对红光子计时的时候转得快些。事实上，这是红光子和蓝光子（或者同其他颜色的光子，包括无线电波、X射线等等）的唯一区别——记秒表指针转速不同", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7CSECeWno", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1665306517, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "694734", "format": "epub", "version": 325453624, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/734/694734/s_694734.jpg", "title": "QED：光和物质的奇妙理论", "author": "R·P·费曼著 徐一鸿序", "translator": "张钟静", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "1.绪论", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7CSEm4dgY", "review": {"bookId": "694734", "content": "科学研究的第一步是找到规律，数学规律，规律距离理论，也就是“为什么”还差一个诺贝尔奖。", "bookVersion": 1115734296, "range": "23746-23864", "abstract": "这些箭头的专业术语是“概率振幅”（probability amplitudes），如果我说我们“正在计算一个事件的概率振幅”，我觉得比较光彩些。不过，我倒倾向于一种更诚实的说法，即我们正在努力求出一个箭头，它的平方代表某事件发生的概率。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7CSEm4dgY", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1665306278, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "694734", "format": "epub", "version": 325453624, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/734/694734/s_694734.jpg", "title": "QED：光和物质的奇妙理论", "author": "R·P·费曼著 徐一鸿序", "translator": "张钟静", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "1.绪论", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}, {"reviewId": "17408780_7CSDcXUuY", "review": {"bookId": "694734", "content": "转速与光速的关系是什么？", "bookVersion": 1115734296, "range": "19660-19821", "abstract": "决定每一个箭头的方向，让我们想象用一个记秒表来记录光子的运动时间。这个假想的记秒表只有一个指针，它转动得飞快。当一个光子离开光源时，我们按动记秒表。只要这个光子在动，记秒表就转（对红光而言，光子前进1英寸，它转36，000圈）。这个光子到达光电倍增管时，我们让记秒表停住。这时指针指定一个方向。那就是我们要画的箭头的方向。", "type": 1, "chapterUid": 7, "reviewId": "17408780_7CSDcXUuY", "userVid": 17408780, "topics": [], "createTime": 1665305227, "flag": 0, "isLike": 0, "isReposted": 0, "book": {"bookId": "694734", "format": "epub", "version": 325453624, "soldout": 1, "bookStatus": 1, "type": 0, "cover": "https://wfqqreader-1252317822.image.myqcloud.com/cover/734/694734/s_694734.jpg", "title": "QED：光和物质的奇妙理论", "author": "R·P·费曼著 徐一鸿序", "translator": "张钟静", "payType": 1048577}, "chapterIdx": 7, "chapterTitle": "1.绪论", "author": {"userVid": 17408780, "name": "钟涵", "avatar": "https://thirdwx.qlogo.cn/mmopen/vi_32/1OfJCYwoJtaLU1wLBu3bTrBODSyuW89Q3VtvETqKuY4TKP83GoRQwpFiaibK7yicKS9fSOicARg2zvEv2aicibgafxxgj1xibWicLjSLbicqiaaFm0H7M/132", "isFollowing": 1, "isFollower": 1, "isBlacking": 0, "isBlackBy": 0, "isHide": 0, "isV": 0, "roleTags": [], "followPromote": "", "isDeepV": true, "deepVTitle": "资深会员", "signature": "", "medalInfo": {"id": "M6-0-1000", "desc": "收到的赞", "title": "收到的赞", "levelIndex": 1000}}}}], "totalCount": 6}}